// Description: Retrieves full network activity and process attribution for a specific endpoint to support forensic investigation and incident response
// Data Source: DeviceNetworkEvents
// Severity: Informational (Forensic / IR Query)
// Category: Incident Response / Host Investigation
// False Positives: None (investigative query, not a detection rule)

DeviceNetworkEvents
| where DeviceName == "  "
| project DeviceName, Timestamp, LocalPort, Protocol, InitiatingProcessFileName, InitiatingProcessCommandLine
| sort by Timestamp desc
